{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2023-05-18 07:30:00', 'title': 'CONAGRA BRANDS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BERNSTEIN 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'CHICAGO , MAY 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONAGRA BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: CAG) WILL ATTEND THE BERNSTEIN 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON THURSDAY, JUNE 1. SEAN CONNOLLY, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF CONAGRA BRANDS, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AND PROVIDE A BUSINESS UPDATE BEGINNING AT 8 A.M.'}